A man reads a book before a visit after a trip.
Every man reads 1 book per 1 day.
Every man reads at most 2 books per 2 weeks.
Every man reads exactly 3 books per 1 hour.
Every man reads at least 4 books per 2 hours.
Every man reads more than 5 books per 1 minute.
Every man reads less than 6 books per 3 months.
A man waits at an interval of at least 1 day during a window of at most 3 weeks of a visit.
A man waits at an interval of less than 2 months during a window of exactly 1 year of a trip.
If a man reads after a visit then the man waits.
